  ====
  - [[Page~69 赫(7) _Hak(7)_ (hak1); here normalised to _H(a/)k(7)_ (haak1)]]
    ==
    - Bright ``red``, splendid, luminous, like a fire or the sun [[Kangxi: 火赤貌 etc., 赫赫然盛也, 赫顯也]];
    - angry [[Kangxi: 赫怒意]];
    - to scorch<## TODO: same as 嚇 (Kangxi: 赫炙也 etc.) ##>, to glisten;
    - clever, elegant;
    - _~~hak(7)~~ ``h(a/)k(7)`` ~~hak(7)~~ ``h(a/)k(7)``_
        [[haak1 haak1 赫赫]]
        hot, glorious, effulgent;
    - _(2)h(i/)n ~~hak(7)~~ ``h(a/)k(7)``_
        [[hin2 haak1 顯赫]]
        a good scholar, talented.
    ==
  ====
P
  ++
  1. A surname (Kangxi: 姓).
  1. Used in 赫連 (a compound surname) (Kangxi: 赫連氏複姓).
  ++
L
  ====
  * 【赫】 (xaek)
    ==
    - (_adjective-like_) fiery-red, fiery
    - (_adjective-like_) (_met._) resplendent
    - (_verb-like_) (_met._) [to] resplend
    ==
  ====
S
  ==
